  "talents_description": {
    "modifier_pudge_1_0": "Rot reduces the target's Magic Resistance: 5%/10%/15%",
    "modifier_pudge_1_1": "Rot reduces the target's Magic Resistance: <b><font color='#eabe10'>5%</font></b>/10%/15%",
    "modifier_pudge_1_2": "Rot reduces the target's Magic Resistance: 5%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b>/15%",
    "modifier_pudge_1_3": "Rot reduces the target's Magic Resistance: 5%/10%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>15%</font></b>",
    "modifier_pudge_2_0": "Increase Rot Radius: 50/100",
    "modifier_pudge_2_1": "Increase Rot Radius: <b><font color='#eabe10'>50</font></b>/100",
    "modifier_pudge_2_2": "Increase Rot Radius: 50/<b><font color='#eabe10'>100</font></b>",
    "modifier_pudge_3_0": "New Active Ability: Rot Bomb \n\n The hero throws a blob of rot that creates Rot at the target location. \n\n Duration: 5 sec. \n Cast Range: 750",
    "modifier_pudge_3_1": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Rot Bomb</font></b> \n\n The hero throws a blob of rot that creates Rot at the target location. \n\n Duration: 5 sec. \n Cast Range: 750",
    "modifier_pudge_4_0": "Increase Rot Damage: 0.25%/0.5%/0.75% from Max Health",
    "modifier_pudge_4_1": "Increase Rot Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>0.25%</font></b>/0.5%/0.75% from Max Health",
    "modifier_pudge_4_2": "Increase Rot Damage: 0.25%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>0.5%</font></b>/0.75% from Max Health",
    "modifier_pudge_4_3": "Increase Rot Damage: 0.25%/0.5%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>0.75%</font></b> from Max Health",
    "modifier_pudge_5_0": "If the Target has been under Rot for more than 5 seconds, then it becomes infected and begins to use Rot itself for the following: 2.5/5 seconds",
    "modifier_pudge_5_1": "If the Target has been under Rot for more than 5 seconds, then it becomes infected and begins to use Rot itself for the following: <b><font color='#eabe10'>2.5</font></b>/5 seconds",
    "modifier_pudge_5_2": "If the Target has been under Rot for more than 5 seconds, then it becomes infected and begins to use Rot itself for the following: 2.5/<b><font color='#eabe10'>5</font></b> seconds",
    "modifier_pudge_6_0": "Rot reduces Enemy Health Restoration: 10%/20%",
    "modifier_pudge_6_1": "Rot reduces Enemy Health Restoration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b>/20%",
    "modifier_pudge_6_2": "Rot reduces Enemy Health Restoration: 10%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b>",
    "modifier_pudge_7_0": "Reduces Dismember Cooldown: 5 sec. \n\n Increases Dismember Duration: 1 sec. \n\n Dismember disables the Target's Passive Abilities while active.",
    "modifier_pudge_7_1": "Reduces Dismember Cooldown: <b><font color='#eabe10'>5</font></b> sec. \n\n Increases Dismember Duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b> sec. \n\n Dismember disables the Target's <b><font color='#eabe10'>Passive Abilities</font></b> while active.",
    "modifier_pudge_8_0": "Meat Shield on activation increases Attack Speed: 30/60/90",
    "modifier_pudge_8_1": "Meat Shield on activation increases Attack Speed: <b><font color='#eabe10'>30</font></b>/60/90",
    "modifier_pudge_8_2": "Meat Shield on activation increases Attack Speed: 30/<b><font color='#eabe10'>60</font></b>/90",
    "modifier_pudge_8_3": "Meat Shield on activation increases Attack Speed: 30/60/<b><font color='#eabe10'>90</font></b>",
    "modifier_pudge_9_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Meat Hook.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Chain Binding \n\n Throws a bloodied hook at the target area. The hook will hook onto the ground and pull the owner of the ability. Hero makes 1/2 attacks against all targets in his path. \n\n Cast Range: 1200 \n Cooldown: 8 seconds",
    "modifier_pudge_9_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Meat Hook.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Chain Binding \n\n Throws a bloodied hook at the target area. The hook will hook onto the ground and pull the owner of the ability. Hero makes <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/2 attacks against all targets in his path. \n\n Cast Range: 1200 \n Cooldown: 8 seconds",
    "modifier_pudge_9_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Meat Hook.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Chain Binding \n\n Throws a bloodied hook at the target area. The hook will hook onto the ground and pull the owner of the ability. Hero makes 1/<b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b> attacks against all targets in his path. \n\n Cast Range: 1200 \n Cooldown: 8 seconds",
